{"kind":"request","text":"Prepare O4's dedicated Worker, dap-connect, and its runbook\n\nScope: O4 of notes/2026-11-02-hosted-mcp-oauth.md, under rulings\na555fc77 (O4 gets its own Worker), c721a1e9 (no dynamic registration)\nand Hugh's order 58c6cb8e (Claude, then ChatGPT). The registration\nswitch d7c3da24 lands first.\n\nThe Worker: dap-connect, at https://dap-connect.inguz.workers.dev,\nwith its own Durable Object namespaces and a fresh register on the\nown-agent cohort from O2. It shares no namespace, register or binding\nwith dap-grow, dap-lending or dap-demo.\n\nDeliver a reviewed head with:\n\n1. apps/room/wrangler.connect.jsonc: the Worker, its bindings, and\n   these settings:\n   - REGISTER_SCOPE as the one placeholder for the planned register;\n   - MCP_ENABLED false, so it deploys closed;\n   - MCP_RESOURCE_URLS with two connector URLs,\n     https://dap-connect.inguz.workers.dev/mcp for Claude and\n     https://dap-connect.inguz.workers.dev/mcp?host=chatgpt for ChatGPT;\n   - MCP_CARD_ORIGINS for both, with Claude's\n     {hash}.claudemcpcontent.com computed from its URL and a unique\n     origin for ChatGPT;\n   - OAUTH_DYNAMIC_REGISTRATION unset, and the default metadata origins\n     and redirect URIs.\n2. A runbook for the planner: plan the register from a new home on this\n   laptop, deploy closed, install, create one witness room with an\n   ordinary member and the repo-in-ai application installed, then the\n   live window. In that window I set MCP_ENABLED true, the builder\n   connects Claude web and then ChatGPT developer mode under UI\n   control, consents as the ordinary member, makes one card press and\n   one act, revokes, and I close the endpoint.\n3. The O4 evidence list: host builds, the initialize and ui/initialize\n   versions, any Origin header, screenshots, and both hosts connected\n   at once.\n\nDone when the configuration and runbook pass the checker's review and\nland on main. The deployment and the live runs follow under my rulings,\nnot this head.\n\nOrder: after the registration switch lands. It runs ahead of the G3b\npacket if both are ready.","body":{"conditions":"apps/room/wrangler.connect.jsonc and the O4 runbook and evidence list land on main after checker review, with the Worker deploying closed and sharing nothing with the three live Workers.","target_head":"c55c59da145c28beecff2b15e35b0d99b7d888b6","target_ref":"refs/heads/main","target_repo":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}